  "id": "tti",
  "term": "TTI",
  "definition": "TTI refers to tourist-to-tourist interaction, meaning the contact and exchanges that travelers have with one another during travel. In this tourism context, the quality of these interactions is described as linked with better travel experiences, greater satisfaction, and stronger loyalty toward destinations.",
